CSOAI Ltd (UK 16939677)

Regulation (EU) 2024/2847 Article 14 reporting clocks apply from 11 September 2026 (13 days from 29 Aug 2026):

- 24 hours: early warning (actively exploited vulnerability or severe incident)
- 72 hours: notification
- 14 days after a corrective/mitigating measure is available: vulnerability final report
- 1 month after the 72-hour notification: severe-incident final report

This is not full CRA conformity. That date is 11 December 2027 (CE mark / essential requirements). Chapter IV (notified bodies) already applied 11 June 2026.

